#: .\templates\about\about.html:13
msgid "About Speedy Net"
msgstr "關於 Speedy Net"

#: .\templates\about\about.html:17 .\templates\main\main_page.html:13
#, python-format
msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://%(language_code)s.speedy.net/\" title=\"Speedy "
"Net\">Speedy Net</a> is a new social network. With Speedy Net you can "
"communicate with your friends. Speedy Net is open to free registration for "
"people from all countries and ages (no age limit!). The site is vegan and "
"vegetarian friendly. It is currently available in %(languages_num)s "
"languages."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"https://%(language_code)s.speedy.net/\" title=\"Speedy "
"Net\">速網</a> Speedy Net 是一個全新的社群網路。透過 Speedy Net，您可以與朋友交流。 Speedy Net "
"向所有國家和地區、所有年齡段的用戶免費開放註冊（沒有年齡限制！）。該網站對素食主義者和純素食主義者友好。目前可在以下地區使用：%(languages_num)s語言。"

#: .\templates\about\about.html:19
msgid ""
"The founders of Speedy Net are vegan, support animal rights and object to "
"experiments on animals. Speedy Net is a social network friendly for vegan "
"and vegetarian people and animals."
msgstr ""
"Speedy Net 的創辦人是純素食主義者，支持動物權利，反對動物實驗。 Speedy Net 是一個對純素食主義者、素食者和動物友好的社交網路。"

#: .\templates\about\about.html:21
msgid ""
"We decided to limit the number of friends on Speedy Net to 800. We encourage"
" you to add as friends only people you know personally. You can select which"
" details will appear on your profile as public, which details only to "
"friends and which details will be private. Private details will appear only "
"to you."
msgstr ""
"我們決定將 Speedy Net 的好友數量限制為 800 "
"人。我們鼓勵您只加入您認識的人為好友。您可以選擇個人資料中哪些資訊公開顯示，哪些資訊僅對好友可見，哪些資訊設為私密。私密資訊僅對您可見。"

#: .\templates\about\about.html:23 .\templates\main\main_page.html:15
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You can use our new app, <a "
"href=\"https://%(language_code)s.speedymatch.com/\" title=\"Speedy "
"Match\">Speedy Match</a>, to find matching people for dating. Speedy Match "
"is open to singles of all ages."
msgstr ""
"您可以使用我們的新應用程序，<a href=\"https://%(language_code)s.speedymatch.com/\" "
"title=\"Speedy Match\">快速比賽</a>旨在幫助單身人士找到合適的約會對象。 Speedy Match開放給所有年齡層的單身人士。"

#: .\templates\about\about.html:25
msgid ""
"All the features on Speedy Net and Speedy Match are free of charge. Join "
"Speedy Net today to find friends, it only takes a few minutes. <a href=\"/\""
" title=\"Join Speedy Net\">Click here</a> to join."
msgstr ""
"Speedy Net 和 Speedy Match 的所有功能都是免費的。立即加入 Speedy Net 結交朋友，只需幾分鐘。<a "
"href=\"/\" title=\"Join Speedy Net\">點這裡</a>加入。"

#: .\templates\about\about.html:27
msgid ""
"Speedy Net is a free software & open source project. If you want to help "
"developing and improving Speedy Net, please contact me by email."
msgstr "Speedy Net 是一個免費開源軟體專案。如果您想協助開發和改進 Speedy Net，請透過電子郵件與我聯繫。"

#: .\templates\about\about.html:29
msgid ""
"Speedy Net is named after <a "
"href=\"https://www.facebook.com/speedy.the.female.dog\" "
"title=\"Speedy\">Speedy</a>, a female dog that was with us for many years "
"and died in 2003. Speedy gave birth to 7 puppies in 1988."
msgstr ""
"Speedy Net 的名字來自<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/speedy.the.female.dog\" "
"title=\"Speedy\">迅速</a>一隻名叫 Speedy 的母狗，陪伴我們多年，於 2003 年去世。 Speedy 於 1988 年生下了"
" 7 隻小狗。"

#: .\templates\about\about.html:31
msgid "Speedy Net is currently in alpha. It was launched in June 2012."
msgstr "Speedy Net目前處於alpha測試階段，於2012年6月發布。"

#: .\templates\about\about.html:33
msgid "Thank you and good luck,"
msgstr "謝謝，祝你好運！"

